### Benchmark workload: a tissue-like semi-infinite medium (low absorption, forward scattering).
### Photons here take hundreds to thousands of steps, unlike the thin-slab validation case.
tissue_g09.mco A    # output filename, ASCII
1000000             # number of photons
0.01 0.01           # dz, dr [cm]
40 50 1             # number of dz, dr and da bins
1                   # number of layers
1.0                 # n above
1.37 0.1 100 0.9 1e8   # n mua[1/cm] mus[1/cm] g d[cm]  (1e8 cm approximates semi-infinite)
1.0                 # n below
